T*
() Tj
T*
(A Sev-1 page must be acknowledged within five minutes. The first qualified) Tj
T*
(responder becomes incident commander until an explicit handoff. The commander) Tj
T*
(assigns communications and operations leads, maintains the timeline, and makes) Tj
T*
(the final decision to resolve the incident.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The customer status page is updated at least every 30 minutes during a Sev-1.) Tj
T*
